Z||000012||Cheever2||11-28-2000||07:27 PM||||Who I'd seriously like to see commentating would be Anthony Munoz (another former Bengal and Hall-of-Famer).  He knows the game, can give the lineman's perspective, he's a decent guy, speaks clearly, and his impressive stature helps give him that "you better listen to me" command of the audience.  I saw him once at a grocery store: he was at the checkout, I was at the back of the store, yet I couldn't have missed him.  Big ol' dude.<P>Otherwise, I'd rather see Kevin Nealon in there instead of Dennis Miller.  His Mister Subliminal thing kills me every time.<BR> ||||reg||1
